          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa vandu va Isiraeli valora zinguru zinene zia Yahova yaguutira vandu va Egebeti, vaatia ligali, kandi vaali nilisuvira mu Yahova kandi mu mutumikiri weve Musa.",
          "type": "text",
